<view class="page me-page"><view wx:if="{{local}}" class="local-banner">本地演练 · 切换角色，体验大家的一顿饭</view><view class="profile-head"><view class="profile-avatar">{{name[0]||'须'}}</view><view class="flex"><view class="profile-name">{{name||'厨房朋友'}}</view><view class="muted">不赶时间，好好吃饭。</view></view><button class="link-button" bindtap="editName">编辑</button></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="note">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{editingName}}" class="card"><view class="label">大家怎么称呼你</view><input class="input" value="{{name}}" maxlength="24" bindinput="input" placeholder="输入厨房里的昵称"/><button class="primary" bindtap="save" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy||!name}}">保存昵称</button></view><view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">我在的厨房</view><button class="link-button" bindtap="create">＋ 创建</button></view><view class="card kitchen-list"><view wx:if="{{!kitchens.length}}" class="kitchen-empty"><view class="dish-name">还没有自己的小厨房</view><view class="muted">记下拿手菜，等朋友来吃饭。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="create">创建第一间厨房</button></view><view class="list-row" wx:for="{{kitchens}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="kitchen-monogram">{{item.name[0]}}</view><view class="flex"><view class="dish-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.role==='owner'?'厨房主人':item.role==='cook'?'协作厨师':'一起吃饭的朋友'}}</view></view><text class="chevron">›</text></view></view><view class="card account-links"><view class="list-row" bindtap="history"><text class="account-icon">餐</text><view class="flex"><view>饭局与历史</view><view class="muted">正在安排的，和一起吃过的</view></view><text class="chevron">›</text></view><view class="list-row" bindtap="invite"><text class="account-icon">约</text><view class="flex"><view>我收到邀请了</view><view class="muted">输入口令，加入朋友的一顿饭</view></view><text class="chevron">›</text></view><view class="list-row" bindtap="settings"><text class="account-icon">安</text><view class="flex"><view>隐私与数据</view><view class="muted">数据导出、反馈与账号管理</view></view><text class="chevron">›</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{local}}" class="card demo-tools"><view class="row"><view class="dish-name">一起试一顿饭</view><text class="tag">演练工具</text></view><view class="muted">准备六道拿手菜、两位已点菜的朋友。示例仅留在本机。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="seed" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">一键准备三人演练</button><view class="label">当前视角：{{actor==='chef'?'须须 · 掌勺':actor==='alice'?'阿宁 · 朋友':'小林 · 朋友'}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="switchActor">切换演练角色</button><view class="form-row"><text>模拟断网，试试草稿</text><switch checked="{{offline}}" bindchange="offline" color="#244B3B"/></view><button class="link-button" bindtap="resetDemo" disabled="{{busy}}">重新开始一次演练</button></view><view class="brand-footer">鱿鱼须须 · 把一顿饭，变成小期待。</view></view>
